": \"AC-12.5\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen labels the value as feed cost per pound of gain and does not label it ROI or profitability.\",\n  \"when\": \"A user views the metric label.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-13\",\n  \"given\": \"Calculator input contains receiving and as-of dates, entry and current average weights and applicable headcounts, feeding events with convertible units and costs, and a target weight.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-13.1\",\n  \"level\": \"unit\",\n  \"then\": \"The returned fields contain days on feed as the date difference, total gain as current total lot weight minus entry total lot weight, ADG as total gain divided by days on feed, total feed as feeding quantities converted to as-fed pounds, FCR as feed pounds divided by total gain, cost of gain as feed cost divided by total gain, and projected market date using ADG or the configured default when ADG is unavailable.\",\n  \"when\": \"The public FeedToGainCalculator.calculate method is called.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-14\",\n  \"given\": \"Dashboard data contains lot, pen, inventory, ration, feeding, weight, and performance data.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-14.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays active lot and pen counts, animals per lot and pen, inventory status, ration usage, daily bunk rate per pen, planned and actual feed, total feed consumed and cost, starting and current weight, total gain, ADG, FCR, feed cost per unit of gain, energy consumed, and best- and worst-performing lot values with the lots identified.\",\n  \"when\": \"A user opens the lot and pen dashboards.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"approved-screens\" kind=\"approved-screens\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"screen\": \"S-1\",\n  \"route\": \"/overview\",\n  \"reqs\": [\n   \"REQ-14\",\n   \"REQ-21\"\n  ],\n  \"states\": [],\n  \"title\": \"188 head on pens\",\n  \"buttons\": [],\n  \"fields\": [],\n  \"columns\": [\n   \"Pen\",\n   \"Occupancy / Capacity\",\n   \"Open Head\",\n   \"Active Lots in Pen\",\n   \"Status\"\n  ],\n  \"messages\": {},\n  \"toasts\": []\n },\n {\n  \"screen\": \"S-3\",\n  \"route\": \"/lots-pens\",\n  \"reqs\": [\n   \"REQ-2\",\n   \"REQ-3\",\n   \"REQ-14\",\n   \"REQ-21\"\n  ],\n  \"states\": [\n   \"Validation when target weight or default gain rate is invalid.\",\n   \"Saved lot assumptions with recalculated forecast.\",\n   \"Unresolved lot or receipt shown as unavailable for pen operations.\"\n  ],\n  \"title\": \"Lots & pens\",\n  \"buttons\": [\n   \"Save lot assumptions\"\n  ],\n  \"fields\": [\n   \"Search lot or pen\",\n   \"Target weight (lb)\",\n   \"Default gain rate (lb/day)\"\n  ],\n  \"columns\": [\n   \"Lot\",\n   \"Pen\",\n   \"Head\",\n   \"Breed & Sex\",\n   \"PO Line Trace\",\n   \"Status\"\n  ],\n  \"messages\": {},\n  \"toasts\": []\n },\n {\n  \"screen\": \"S-9\",\n  \"route\": \"/weights\",\n  \"reqs\": [\n   \"REQ-11\",\n   \"REQ-12\",\n   \"REQ-21\"\n  ],\n  \"states\": [\n   \"Invalid measurement validation returned without saving.\",\n   \"Measurement saved or edited; refreshed metrics are shown.\",\n   \"Delete confirmation states that deletion cannot be undone.\",\n   \"Deleted measurement with refreshed metrics.\"\n  ],\n  \"title\": \"Weight records\",\n  \"buttons\": [\n   \"Save weight record\",\n   \"Edit\",\n   \"Delete\",\n   \"Cancel\",\n   \"Confirm delete\"\n  ],\n  \"fields\": [\n   \"Target lot\",\n   \"Measurement date\",\n   \"Applicable headcount\",\n   \"Average weight (lb/head)\",\n   \"Recorded by\"\n  ],\n  \"columns\": [\n   \"Date\",\n   \"Avg weight\",\n   \"Head\",\n   \"Gain / ADG\",\n   \"Logged by\",\n   \"Status\",\n   \"Actions\"\n  ],\n  \"messages\": {},\n  \"toasts\": []\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"stubs\" kind=\"stubs\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"path\": \"lib/feed-to-gain-calculator.ts\",\n  \"content\": \"export type FeedUnit = \\\"lb\\\" | \\\"kg\\\" | \\\"ton\\\";\\n\\nexport interface FeedToGainEvent {\\n  quantity: number;\\n  unit: FeedUnit;\\n  cost: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FeedToGainInput {\\n  receivingDate: string;\\n  asOfDate: string;\\n  entryAverageWeightLb: number;\\n  currentAverageWeightLb: number;\\n  entryHeadcount: number;\\n  currentHeadcount: number;\\n  feedingEvents: FeedToGainEvent[];\\n  targetWeightLb: number;\\n  defaultAdgLbPerDay: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FeedToGainResult {\\n  daysOnFeed: number;\\n  totalGainLb: number;\\n  averageDailyGainLbPerDay: number | null;\\n  totalFeedAsFedLb: number;\\n  feedConversionRatio: number | null;\\n  feedCostPerPoundOfGain: number | null;\\n  projectedMarketDate: string | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport class FeedToGainCalculator {\\n  static calculate(_input: FeedToGainInput): FeedToGainResult {\\n    throw new Error(\\\"not implemented\\\");\\n  }\\n}\\n\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<pointers>\n- contracts/openapi.yaml: the locked API contract; the client and test handlers in lib/api are generated from it\n</pointers>\n\nWrite the acceptance and characterisation tests now.\nBefore you return, check your list against the criteria: each of these needs at least one test in it: AC-11.1, AC-11.2, AC-11.3, AC-12.1, AC-12.2, AC-12.3, AC-12.4, AC-12.5, AC-13.1, AC-14.1.\nThis session is cut off after 60 turns, 45 minutes or about $2 of model use, whichever comes first, and you are not warned. Long tool output, whole-file rewrites and reading a file again all use it up. Write every test first, then check them.\n\n<recap>\n- one test per AC\n- tests fail now for the right reason\n- characterisation tests pass today\n- don't touch production code\n</recap>"}